# 清理选择器演示 · vhs demo/selector.tape
Output selector.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1160
Set Height 800
Set Padding 22
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set Framerate 12

Hide
Type "cd ~/.claude/skills/hekouwang-env-doctor-skill" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 500ms
Type "bash scripts/clean.sh --dry-run" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 8s
Down Sleep 500ms
Space Sleep 900ms
Down Sleep 400ms
Space Sleep 1200ms
Down Sleep 300ms
Down Sleep 300ms
Space Sleep 1400ms
Down Sleep 700ms
Down Sleep 700ms
Down Sleep 700ms
Down Sleep 900ms
Space Sleep 1600ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
